Ephemeris data
  Positions come from the Moshier analytic ephemeris built into the Swiss
  Ephemeris library (SEFLG_MOSEPH). No ephemeris data files (*.se1) are
  shipped or read. Swiss Ephemeris data files, if anyone adds them, are
  covered by the Swiss Ephemeris licence terms as well; this service does
  not support loading them.

